Estop
valign=top
--
Entry:
  driveStop()
  closeJunction()
  removeAllWorkpieces()
  emptyChute()
  lightRedBlinkFast()
  setAdcIdleState()

Exit → Idle (kein H*):
  RESET_PRESSED
  [localEstop frei
   &amp;&amp; partnerEstop frei]

Bei CONNECTION_RESTORED:
  lightYellowOff()
  lightGreenOff()
  (bleibt in Estop)</panel_attributes>
